      "boundary": "Every complete unmasked convex insertion mixture closes at its stated normalized band, uniformly all z_N in [0,1]. Arbitrary B is fixed within the averaged run; no uncontrolled B_n. S3 tail is three-insertion centered control uniform theta/gaps/j, not j=1,2 pointwise control. No raw coefficient N^-2 bound, Hamming/high-switch extraction, source derivatives/rates, deconvolution or undamped zero-insertion identification. T16, Ward(13), balanced law, TRACE005 and BGS OPEN. Author222 suite inaccessible and unreplayed; no formalization.",
